OL,3,APlans for major overhaul of councils
OL,4,Ahalted
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans for a major shake-up of local
OL,7,Fgovernment are on hold, after the
OL,8,Fgovernment launched a review in light
OL,9,Fof new legal advice.
OL,11,FProposals to merge smaller councils to
OL,12,Fform larger authorities in Essex,
OL,13,FHampshire, Norfolk and Suffolk have
OL,14,Fbeen withdrawn.
OL,16,FMeanwhile, plans for 14 other areas
OL,17,Fwill also be reviewed and paused.
OL,19,FReorganisation in Surrey, where
OL,20,Fcouncillors for two new unitary
OL,21,Fauthorities were elected in May, will
OL,22,Fnot be affected by the review.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/38
